    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Distance You Travel Is Your Currency</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rack up Kilometers as you automatically drive forward, then spend them to upgrade your vehicle.\u00a0 The further you drive, the faster you drive, which lets you drive further, faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/3d0657063baedf68bad863448d340131.poster.avif?t=1750803699\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/3d0657063baedf68bad863448d340131.webm?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/3d0657063baedf68bad863448d340131.mp4?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Preferred Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver your way around obstacles with Handling or brute force your way through them with Armor. Select upgrades that let you combo Boosts or opt to automate them entirely.\u00a0 Whether you prefer an active playstyle or want to sit back and idle, there exists a build you can enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/00d71c36d8db341c7c8bd949fd853348.poster.avif?t=1750803699\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/00d71c36d8db341c7c8bd949fd853348.webm?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/00d71c36d8db341c7c8bd949fd853348.mp4?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reinforce Upgrades Exponentially</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scroll through an  extensive array of upgrades, then decide which ones to strengthen, improving their power, duration, effectiveness, and more. Uncovering additional secrets will let you promote upgrades even further beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/f0fb9a86368d3db09b39a5eaf2114048.poster.avif?t=1750803699\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/f0fb9a86368d3db09b39a5eaf2114048.webm?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/f0fb9a86368d3db09b39a5eaf2114048.mp4?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save The Girl...?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race back to your childhood friend- a trusting girl who's been hurt one too many times.\u00a0 You can't seem to remember how you got separated, but her overprotective friend won't hesitate to remind you of all the times you screwed up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/064b74a8c521eb5e01c12795836cd846.avif?t=1750803699\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Distance You Travel Is Your Currency</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rack up Kilometers as you automatically drive forward, then spend them to upgrade your vehicle.\u00a0 The further you drive, the faster you drive, which lets you drive further, faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/3d0657063baedf68bad863448d340131.poster.avif?t=1750803699\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/3d0657063baedf68bad863448d340131.webm?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/3d0657063baedf68bad863448d340131.mp4?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Preferred Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver your way around obstacles with Handling or brute force your way through them with Armor. Select upgrades that let you combo Boosts or opt to automate them entirely.\u00a0 Whether you prefer an active playstyle or want to sit back and idle, there exists a build you can enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/00d71c36d8db341c7c8bd949fd853348.poster.avif?t=1750803699\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/00d71c36d8db341c7c8bd949fd853348.webm?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/00d71c36d8db341c7c8bd949fd853348.mp4?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reinforce Upgrades Exponentially</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scroll through an  extensive array of upgrades, then decide which ones to strengthen, improving their power, duration, effectiveness, and more. Uncovering additional secrets will let you promote upgrades even further beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/f0fb9a86368d3db09b39a5eaf2114048.poster.avif?t=1750803699\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/f0fb9a86368d3db09b39a5eaf2114048.webm?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/f0fb9a86368d3db09b39a5eaf2114048.mp4?t=1750803699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save The Girl...?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race back to your childhood friend- a trusting girl who's been hurt one too many times.\u00a0 You can't seem to remember how you got separated, but her overprotective friend won't hesitate to remind you of all the times you screwed up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346820/extras/064b74a8c521eb5e01c12795836cd846.avif?t=1750803699\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A car-upgrading, meta-unveiling incremental game where two girls fight over your attention. Race along an obstacle-ridden track to gain Km, then spend Km to level up and purchase upgrades. Travel far enough to reunite with your true love- if the entire world doesn't break before then...",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201c[The story] made me want to hug my wife towards the end.\u201d<br>- Playtester<br><br>\u201cI just finished with it, and tried to give a feedback worthy of this masterpiece! \ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\udc4d Seriously man, it was hard to find anything wrong with it, i would really feel it's put together with lots of love!\u201d<br>- Vargabazsaa<br><br>\u201cThe game was really well paced. Driving around keeps you interacting.\u201d<br>- Beta tester<br>",
